OL,3,CWoman, 29, arrested after five houses
OL,4,Cdestroyed in fire
OL,6,FA woman has been arrested following a
OL,7,Ffire which destroyed five homes in
OL,8,FPantside, Newbridge.
OL,10,FThe 29-year-old from Newbridge has
OL,11,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of arson
OL,12,Fwith recklessness as to whether life
OL,13,Fwas endangered, and remains in police
OL,14,Fcustody.
OL,16,FIn a statement from Gwent Police, the
OL,17,Fforce confirmed 32 homes have been
OL,18,Fevacuated and no injuries were
OL,19,Freported.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G1/3
