OL,3,CWoman, 29, arrested after five houses
OL,4,Cdestroyed in fire
OL,6,FThe statement added: "We understand
OL,7,Fthat there are a lot of ongoing
OL,8,Fwildfires across the country, however
OL,9,FI would like to make it clear that we
OL,10,Fdo not consider this fire to be linked
OL,11,Fto any other wildfires.
OL,13,F"This fire has caused significant
OL,14,Fdamage to a number of residential
OL,15,Fproperties, which will have a
OL,16,Fdevastating impact on those in the
OL,17,Flocal community."
OL,19,FCrews were called to Hazelwood Road on
OL,20,FWednesday afternoon (12 August) after
OL,21,Freports of a property fire.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/3
