OL,3,CWoman, 29, arrested after five houses
OL,4,Cdestroyed in fire
OL,6,FSouth Wales Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,Fsaid: "The incident has now been
OL,8,Fsignificantly scaled back, with
OL,9,Ffirefighting operations largely
OL,10,Fconcluded.
OL,12,F"Crews have transitioned into the
OL,13,Frecovery phase and are working towards
OL,14,Fhanding the incident over to the local
OL,15,Fauthority and other relevant agencies."
